.TH CF-CONFIG 1 "September 2026" "cf-cli v1.1.2" "Cloudflare CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
cf-config.1 \- Manage persistent CLI authentication profiles and defaults
.PP
Manage persistent authentication profiles, default output formats, and environment switching stored in \fB~/.cf/config.json\fR.
.PP
.PP
.SH SUBCOMMANDS OVERVIEW
.PP
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcf config set\fR (#cf-config-set) — Create or update an authentication profile
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcf config get\fR (#cf-config-get) — Display stored configuration for a profile
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcf config list\fR (#cf-config-list) — List all saved profiles and indicate active default
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcf config use\fR (#cf-config-use) — Switch the active default profile
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcf config delete\fR (#cf-config-delete) — Remove a profile
.PP
.PP
.SS "\fBcf config set\fR"
.PP
Creates or updates a profile in \fB~/.cf/config.json\fR.
.PP
.PP
\fBSyntax\fR
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf config set --name <profile-name> [credentials & defaults]
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
\fBFlags\fR
.PP
.PP
.RS 2
.TP
\fB--name <name>\fR
\fIType:\fR string | \fIDescription:\fR \fIrequired\fR Profile identifier (letters, digits, and hyphens)
.TP
\fB--token <token>\fR
\fIType:\fR string | \fIDescription:\fR Cloudflare API token
.TP
\fB--api-key <key>\fR
\fIType:\fR string | \fIDescription:\fR Cloudflare Global API Key (requires \fB--email\fR)
.TP
\fB--email <email>\fR
\fIType:\fR string | \fIDescription:\fR Account email address
.TP
\fB--account-id <id>\fR
\fIType:\fR string | \fIDescription:\fR Default Account ID for this profile
.TP
\fB--zone-id <id>\fR
\fIType:\fR string | \fIDescription:\fR Default Zone ID for this profile
.TP
\fB--output <format>\fR
\fIType:\fR string | \fIDescription:\fR Preferred output format (\fBtable\fR, \fBjson\fR, \fBcsv\fR, \fByaml\fR)
.RE
.PP
.PP
.PP
\fBExamples\fR
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
# Set default profile with API token
cf config set --name default --token "cfut_MySecretToken123"

# Create a staging profile with a specific Account ID
cf config set --name staging --token "staging-token" --account-id "023e105f4ecef8ad9ca31a8372d0c353"

# Create profile using legacy global API key
cf config set --name legacy --api-key "global-key-xyz" --email "dev@example.com"
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
.SS "\fBcf config list\fR"
.PP
Lists all stored profiles, their authentication methods, and marks which profile is currently default.
.PP
.PP
\fBSyntax\fR
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf config list
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
\fBExample Output\fR
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
┌──────────────────────┬──────────┬────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┬─────────┐
│ Profile              │ Auth     │ Email                          │ Account ID                         │ Default │
├──────────────────────┼──────────┼────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────┼─────────┤
│ default              │ token    │ -                              │ -                                  │ Yes     │
│ staging              │ token    │ -                              │ 023e105f4ecef8ad9ca31a8372d0c353   │         │
└──────────────────────┴──────────┴────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────┴─────────┘
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
.SS "\fBcf config use\fR"
.PP
Switches the active default profile.
.PP
.PP
\fBSyntax\fR
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf config use --name <profile-name>
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
\fBExample\fR
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf config use --name staging
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
.SS "\fBcf config get\fR"
.PP
Inspects stored settings for a specific profile (tokens are masked for security).
.PP
.PP
\fBSyntax\fR
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf config get --name <profile-name>
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
.SS "\fBcf config delete\fR"
.PP
Removes a profile from configuration.
.PP
.PP
\fBSyntax\fR
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf config delete --name <profile-name> [--yes]
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
.PP
\fBExample\fR
.PP
.PP
.nf
.ft CW
cf config delete --name staging --yes
.ft
.fi
.PP
.PP
